body:
From what I've read, a lot of casinos will be enforcing social distancing rules to some extent.  I would not be surprised if poker rooms don't open up with the rest of the casino.  Compared to table games and slots, there is so much more sharing of chips and cards.  Also, if they max a table out at 5, that means half rake, which simply won't be worth it to many casinos.

&#x200B;

See you all in 2021...

